  "body": "## What changed\n\nThis PR makes main green again. Post-merge run 44320796021 on 8643d9bb7 had 4 failed steps of 874.\n\n1. `examples/first-router-part.nc` has new content, recorded from `camcraft-cli process examples/first-router-part.camproj`. One line changes: `G73 X53 Y50 Z-13 R0 Q4 F150` becomes `G73 X53 Y50 Z-14.803 R0 Q4 F150`.\n2. `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/thread_mill_m8_multi_form.nc` has new content. Only the tool comment, `T` and `H` lines change: TM-0600-P125 T02/H02 -> T01/H01, TAP-DRILL T01/H01 -> T02/H02.\n3. `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/thread_mill_external_m8_multi_form.nc` has new content. Only the tool comment, `T` and `H` lines change: TM-0600-P125 T02/H02 -> T01/H01, EM-1000-4FL T01/H01 -> T03/H03.\n4. `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/guide_projects.rs`: the demo projects go to `<temp>/camcraft-guide-projects-<pid>`, and the test removes that directory at the end. `CAMCRAFT_GUIDE_PROJECTS_OUT` still selects the output for `cargo xtask docs-images` and the catalog media. A new test pins the default path.\n5. `docs/decisions/2543-main-red-posts.md` records the decision.\n\n## Cause of each failure\n\n- `first_part_programs::first_router_part_posts_the_shipped_program`: #2504 (merge 90e016a6e) and #2488 (merge c9b1366ac) clash.\n  - #2504 saved `examples/first-router-part.camproj` at v68 with `\"break_through_from\": \"full_diameter\"`.\n  - #2488 recorded the `.nc` pin at the same time, so neither PR saw the change of the other.\n  - The new depth is correct. The extra 1.803 mm is the point length of the 6 mm 118 deg drill: `3 / tan(59 deg) = 1.803`.\n- `thread_mill::a_multi_form_mill_threads_m8_clean_and_posts_helical_moves` and `thread_boss::an_external_m8_thread_verifies_clean_and_posts_helical_moves`: #2488 (merge c9b1366ac) makes tool numbers stable.\n  - `AddTool` gives the lowest free number in the order of addition.\n  - The fixtures add the thread mill first, so the thread mill is now T01.\n  - Each operation still calls its own tool with the matching `H` word. No motion line changes.\n- `egui_app::tests::guide_projects::demo_projects_build_and_load_with_valid_paths`: the runner environment causes this failure. It is not a regression.\n  - The gate log artifact shows `save /tmp/camcraft-guide-projects/guide-workholding.camproj: I/O error: Permission denied (os error 13)`.\n  - A fixed name in a shared temp directory belongs to the first account that makes it.\n  - The failure is older than this window: runs 44285991575, 44296963679 and 44302217388 also failed it. The test came from #1902.\n\nNo failure is wrong posted G-code. Thus no issue is P1.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `first_part_programs::first_router_part_posts_the_shipped_program`\n- `thread_mill::a_multi_form_mill_threads_m8_clean_and_posts_helical_moves`\n- `thread_boss::an_external_m8_thread_verifies_clean_and_posts_helical_moves`\n- `egui_app::tests::guide_projects::demo_projects_build_and_load_with_valid_paths`\n- `egui_app::tests::guide_projects::default_projects_dir_belongs_to_this_process` (new)\n\n## Gate results\n\n- Each binary, run one by one: first_part_programs 2/2, thread_boss 12/12, thread_mill 8/8, guide_projects 3/3.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean. The app crate has only golden changes.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main` on base 37bde5e9a: 555 steps, 0 failed, 53.4 min.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- The ui fix is not run on the Linux runner account that owns the old `/tmp/camcraft-guide-projects`. The next post-merge run shows it.\n- Main moved to 7491ce4d6 after the gate. `git merge-tree` shows a clean merge. Only `crates/app/src/commands/operation/geometry.rs` changed in the touched area (2 lines). The gate did not run on the merged tree.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #2543\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
